     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Dear all,</div><div><br></div><div>Using secr.fit function I found a warning message in some of the models I was trying to fit:</div><div><br>M0C &lt;-secr.fit(roe_capthist, mask=mask_prox, model = list(D~1, g0~1, sigma~1))<br>MbC &lt;-secr.fit(roe_capthist, mask=mask_prox, model = list(D~1, g0~b, sigma~1))<br>MtC &lt;-secr.fit(roe_capthist, mask=mask_prox, model = list(D~1, g0~t, sigma~1))<br>MbtC &lt;-secr.fit(roe_capthist, mask=mask_prox, model = list(D~1, g0~b+t, sigma~1))<br>MTC &lt;-secr.fit(roe_capthist, mask=mask_prox, model = list(D~1, g0~T, sigma~1))<br>MBC &lt;-secr.fit(roe_capthist, mask=mask_prox, model = list(D~1, g0~B, sigma~1))<br>MbkC &lt;-secr.fit(roe_capthist, mask=mask_prox, model = list(D~1, g0~bk, sigma~1))<br>MBkC &lt;-secr.fit(roe_capthist, mask=mask_prox, model = list(D~1, g0~Bk, sigma~1))<br>MKC &lt;-secr.fit(roe_capthist, mask=mask_prox, model = list(D~1, g0~K, sigma~1))<br>MK_NMC &lt;-secr.fit(roe_capthist, mask=mask_prox, model = list(D~1, g0~K, sigma~1),method=&quot;Nelder-Mead&quot;)<br>MkC &lt;-secr.fit(roe_capthist, mask=mask_prox, model = list(D~1, g0~k, sigma~1))<br>Mh2C &lt;-secr.fit(roe_capthist, mask=mask_prox, model = list(D~1, g0~h2, sigma~1))<br>Mh2_NMC &lt;-secr.fit(roe_capthist, mask=mask_prox, model = list(D~1, g0~h2, sigma~1),method=&quot;Nelder-Mead&quot;)<br>Mh2_NM_SLC &lt;-secr.fit(roe_capthist, mask=mask_prox, model = list(D~1, g0~h2, sigma~1),method=&quot;Nelder-Mead&quot;,start=list(D=0.00012,g0=0.24,sigma=3200))<br>Mh2_NM_SM0C &lt;-secr.fit(roe_capthist, mask=mask_prox, model = list(D~1, g0~h2, sigma~1),method=&quot;Nelder-Mead&quot;,start=M0)</div><div><br></div><div>Here the warning message delivered:</div><div><br><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols;font-size:12pt\" dir=\"ltr\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols;font-size:12pt\" dir=\"ltr\"><pre style=\"margin:0px;border:currentColor;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-transform:none;line-height:10px;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt!important;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Warning message:\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">In secr.fit(roe_capthist, mask = mask_prox, model = list(D ~ 1,  :\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"> possible maximization error: nlm returned code 3. See ?nlm</span></span></pre></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols;font-size:12pt\" dir=\"ltr\"></div><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols;font-size:12pt\" dir=\"ltr\"> </p><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols;font-size:12pt\" dir=\"ltr\">This is the information given by R about ?nlm :<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\">Non linear minimization warning code 3</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\">: L</span><span style=\"font:13.33px/normal sans-serif,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;display:inline!important;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\">ast global step failed to locate a point lower than</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"> </span></span><code style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);text-transform:none;line-height:normal;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:13.33px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\">estimate</span></code><span style=\"font:13.33px/normal sans-serif,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;display:inline!important;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\">. Either</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"> </span></span><code style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);text-transform:none;line-height:normal;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:13.33px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\">estimate</span></code><span style=\"font:13.33px/normal sans-serif,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;display:inline!important;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\">is an </span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\">approximate local minimum of the function or</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"> </span></span><code style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);text-transform:none;line-height:normal;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:13.33px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\">steptol</span></code><span style=\"font:13.33px/normal sans-serif,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;display:inline!important;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\">is too small</span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols;font-size:12pt\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols;font-size:12pt\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font:13.33px/normal sans-serif,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;display:inline!important;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">Do someone know the meaning of this warning message and if it really affect the results of the fitted models?</font></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Se